# Waterlogged Grove: "{T}, Pay 1 life: Add {G} or {U}." The color is named as it is activated (CR 106.5): green here (the
# existing scenario taps it for blue), and white, black, red and colorless are refused. The life is a cost (CR 118.12),
# paid again on every activation: tapped on turn 1 and again on turn 3 after it untaps, Bot1 is at 18.

[Bot1 Deck]
Waterlogged Grove
Island x19

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Waterlogged Grove.Play
! Bot1.Battlefield.Waterlogged Grove.Activate(Color: White)
! Bot1.Battlefield.Waterlogged Grove.Activate(Color: Black)
! Bot1.Battlefield.Waterlogged Grove.Activate(Color: Red)
! Bot1.Battlefield.Waterlogged Grove.Activate(Color: Colorless)
Bot1.Battlefield.Waterlogged Grove.Activate(Ability: Add; Color: Green)
Bot1.Choose(Tap Waterlogged Grove)
? Bot1.Mana = {G}
? Bot1.Life = 19
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Waterlogged Grove.Activate(Ability: Add; Color: Green)
Bot1.Choose(Tap Waterlogged Grove)
? Bot1.Life = 18

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 18
Bot1.Battlefield.Waterlogged Grove.Tapped = true
